1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Molecular search result ≠ species claim

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:11,400
Input: Sequence ID / BLAST / BOLD / UNITE / lab CSV

3
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:17,300
Read identity, coverage, competitors,
reference/QC evidence and metadata

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:22,200
Apply configured gates in a fixed order

5
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:27,500
Mixed demo: 4 records processed

6
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:33,400
Fail-closed result: 0 species rule-pass

7
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:39,100
1 genus rule-pass · 2 ambiguous · 1 weak

8
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:44,400
Run-local decisions — not confirmed identifications

9
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:50,300
Decision Memo: bounded outcome before export

10
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:56,700
Ledger: every count, denominator and rate remains visible

11
00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:03,600
Naive workflow: 4 species-ranked top hits

12
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:10,100
EcoGenesis: 4 blocked or downgraded

13
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:15,000
A first-ranked hit does not become species truth

14
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,200
Each sequence keeps its decision reason

15
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:25,700
Indistinguishable competitor → LCA downgrade

16
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:28,400
Low coverage → weak result

17
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,800
Missing occurrence metadata blocks publication,
not the underlying molecular evidence

18
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:37,000
Evidence Pack: inspectable files, not a hidden score

19
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Decision table + publication blockers + repair plan

20
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:49,300
Human-readable report + machine-readable rule evidence

21
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:55,400
Graph provenance and audits preserve the path to result

22
00:01:55,400 --> 00:02:01,200
Evidence Map: GBIF occurrence context beside molecular rules

23
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:07,200
Occurrence rows stay unlinked without shared identifiers

24
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:13,300
Spatial context cannot strengthen a molecular claim

25
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:18,000
Source mode, graph checks and release checks stay visible

26
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Fragment Graph: query → hits → lineages → bounded taxon

27
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:30,200
Quercus robur and Q. petraea share the rbcL evidence

28
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:36,000
Lowest common ancestor: Quercus / genus

29
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:41,400
Valid only within this reference set and ruleset

30
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:47,200
Methods publish the decision contract

31
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:53,400
Identity + coverage + competitor/LCA + barcode gap

32
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:59,700
Diagnostic k-mers + assay + publication fields + provenance

33
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:04,000
Internal consistency ≠ independent scientific validation

34
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:09,400
EcoGenesis V2: bounded decisions, repair and review

35
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:14,600
Inspect the artifacts. Validate externally before publication.
